    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gisigala rabearda ea sabiibu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goobaloolan Ng'asheanda Ng'utamiida nea gwayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Orjeeda Siida, rukuni daanghwaaja, ak girukusi fuga Israeli ghwasiildeanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eeshiina gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, rabearda haw mideawa meang'eega hees, ea dabiniga geawi aba meang'eega, nea gwandeawa dabiniga saang'a bea oormeeda saang'a. Abeeda ghwahidu Lebanoni ak ghoang'waay uhuuda gubooyeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwalach damealeanda mida humng'eeda, aba jeeda damealgaaschi ak ghwaat ea ghoahiita ng'eanyiida siikeakshacheewa ak ghwayiin jeeda mujiineeda ageasi haleanjeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gageanu gicha histeanga aba jeeda histeaydeaba ng'eanyiita, ak gwahista aba jeeda sigeeda jiilu muuchi, ak ghwayiin ghuuta beega saang'a, hean ghang'aapta gawuurji geeta heedu aba ghuuta eenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwaheedu ak ghoah sabiibooda darda muuchi, nea ea nuwaas, nea damealgaaschi gwayamsa geaw, ak hawungaaschi gwanda hing'eadaydaanyi. Hean ghoah sabiibu, ak gooruudu damealga ak ghafiirfiir.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abeeda gwanda rabearda nuut haw, mideawa meang'eega hees ea dabiniga saang'a, nea sabiiboodida ghaghwana hawungaaschi nea gagal headaanyi. Ak ghaftu damealgaaschi nea gagal headaanyi ghang'eada heeda geengaaschi ghayi hista aba gideaba gwaramsa niny beega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghayi abeeda geehistaneey aba jeeda sigeeda miyaas. Aba ghuuta beega saang'a, ea gideaba gajaruuni damealga, ak gijiili haghweega huwa sabiibooda miy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi baloola ang'iing'i, gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, heapi? Nih gayghwanyagaada? Niny mayghwaloata hawungaaschi, ak ghwalajaada haghweagaaschi gideaba ghwajaami? Ea gideaba seengaaschi shabeadi sean fudu ghwajaam earapeadi mandeawana uurda haw. Ghana fuga saang'a jea ghwaloata bea hawungaaschi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asaha ng'ula earapeadi sing'aaptaneey heapi! Gaynyagaada? Mayghaghajaamiit muuchi inyas ghwalas jeameeda gayeewi? Asaha gayghaghajaamiida aba heeda geenga ghayi sihisaneey.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Iita galeega",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeeshean NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asi anyaasha fiisu heawanaaniin ea ghwanal gideabeedeaba galeesuun. Eeshiina saawa ghayi ghwahidu sugoocheanda Babeli Yerusalemu, ak ghoang'waay sugoocheanda ea fugaaschi hees ak ghwaat Babeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama ng'ata gageanu fiisu ng'ay bea jeata sugoocheanda. Ak gawa neajeeda sea niny ak gweaksa habeawooda ak gageanda fuga mideawa uurjeenga bea ng'eanyiita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba ea mwanyasa uurda sugoocheanduumeeni, ak ghamiinaada nea ghoang'waay neajeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak sugoocheandida eeshiin ghaheawa sugoocheanda Babeli, ak goojeakta buuneeda ng'eanyiida Misri gamus faraasi ea lugooda saang'a; heapi sugoocheanji gayghwanyagaada? Heapi siida sin ng'asheanji ak ghwadatas neajeadaanyi abeeda gayghoamu gamulsa girgweageeda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideabideati gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, sugoocheandida gaygameewsa ng'eanyiida Babeli, ng'eanyiida sugoocheandida ghayi siyiin ghoah sugoocheandean, nea gafool habeawoodida, ak ghwadatas neajeedida ghayi sin sea ninyiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Farao ea lugoadaanyi haw, ea fuga saang'a bwatgeat, maygwarachi gil aba ng'ucheeda. Inyas gooneaweesa museasooda ea ghamarda aba gideaba ghabwar fuga saang'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba nifool habeawooda ak ghwadatas neajeeda, aba gideaba ghoahaakta geatindaanyi ak gwasin haleanjeeni seaniin, asi mayghaghu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, aba gideabideati aba huumwa habeawoodeanyu ghayi fool ea neajeedeanyu ghayi datas abeeda gayghwanyas girgweaksiinda huumwa ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydaabwarghaan gheareedaneedeanyu, aba badaydaanyi, ak gayghoang'waay ghuduumbwaadeedeanyu, ak gaydeadu ea daahiidu Babeli. Ak gawa jeeda girgweageeda aba giidiinyeanda adiiysean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea fugaaschi mang'aw sean ea lugoadaanyi sean gajeabwar aba ng'uta. Nea boosteanga gaygwadarsa meadajeega sean, ak gajanala gideaba aniini NG'UTAMIIDA gil, neargu ng'asheanji.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Heeleesiinda ASEETA bea rarooda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, “Aniini gaydageanda uhuuda gubooyeanda was heetiyeada. Ak geang'eapsi hich ak damealgaaschi mida heeda diyeada, gaydageanda damealeanjagi duu ghaftu, ak gaydang'eapsa uhuuda giijeeda geaw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asaha, gaydang'aapta aba uhuuda giijeeda geaw, bea fuga Israeli, ak ghafiirfiir nea gwaji haghweega. Ak gayghoah gubooyeanda miy, nea hing'eadaydaanyi gaygoobiida heeluutka dariidaka nea ghwadeas ghoorajeega nyaawa aba damealgaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gayghwanal geediga sean bea madamnyeanda gideaba aniini NG'UTAMIIDA gil, inyeessa ghaanung' gaweay ng'eanyi geediga geawi. Nea ghaanung' gaweay humng'eeda geediga nuweagi, nea ghaanung' gagajeamiidi geediga shabeadi nea ghaftu geediga gajeami ng'asheanji gearugu aniini NG'UTAMIIDA nea ng'asheanji geasinyi aniini.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
